cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ContactSched"
abstract: ""Ground-station contact scheduling under multi-mission contention — station masks and sgp4 ephemerides into visibility windows, priority-ordered first-fit against an exact MILP assignment with declared fairness constraints, and the output that distinguishes it: contention and fairness metrics naming who was starved, by how much, and what the priority scheme actually delivered against what it promised, with max-min share and Jain index behaviour under priority inversion exhibited; learned conflict predictor for unsatisfiable requests scored against a demand-over-supply ratio baseline per station-window.""
type: software
